title: "Palm biodiesel blend dispatch"
abstract: >-
  Two-stage stochastic unit commitment and economic dispatch for an isolated
  diesel-photovoltaic-battery microgrid, run separately across nine palm
  biodiesel blends (B0 to B100) under solar-uncertainty scenarios. Includes the
  model, input data, sweep scripts, and the scripts that build every table and
  figure in the associated study.
